### 所有示例均为占位值；点击具体请求才执行，短信请求可能发送真实短信。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:17892
@origin = http://127.0.0.1:5173
@session_id = replace-login-session
@csrf = replace-csrf-token
@cookie = replace-cookie-token
@stoken = replace-authorized-stoken
@stuid = 123456
@mid = replace-authorized-mid
@uid = 506005588
@region = cn_qd01
@verification_id = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### 1 创建短信流程，不发送短信
POST {{base}}/api/mihoyo/login/start
Content-Type: application/json

{"mobile":"13800000000","area_code":"+86"}

### 2 发送真实短信：本人需要时才执行；验证码任务结果以文档为准
POST {{base}}/api/mihoyo/login/sms
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id":"{{session_id}}"}

### 3 提交短信验证码
POST {{base}}/api/mihoyo/login/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id":"{{session_id}}","captcha":"123456"}

### 4 查询短信流程
POST {{base}}/api/mihoyo/login/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id":"{{session_id}}"}

### 5 删除短信流程
POST {{base}}/api/mihoyo/login/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id":"{{session_id}}"}

### 6 无状态账号查询
POST {{base}}/api/mihoyo/game/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"stoken":"{{stoken}}","stuid":"{{stuid}}","mid":"{{mid}}"}

### 7 无状态总览，不保存数据库
POST {{base}}/api/genshin/overview
Content-Type: application/json

{"stoken":"{{stoken}}","stuid":"{{stuid}}","mid":"{{mid}}","game_uid":"{{uid}}","game_biz":"hk4e_cn","region":"{{region}}"}

### 8 无状态角色列表
POST {{base}}/api/genshin/characters
Content-Type: application/json

{"stoken":"{{stoken}}","stuid":"{{stuid}}","mid":"{{mid}}","game_uid":"{{uid}}","game_biz":"hk4e_cn","region":"{{region}}"}

### 9 无状态装备详情
POST {{base}}/api/genshin/characters/details
Content-Type: application/json

{"stoken":"{{stoken}}","stuid":"{{stuid}}","mid":"{{mid}}","game_uid":"{{uid}}","game_biz":"hk4e_cn","region":"{{region}}","character_ids":["10000089"]}

### 10 创建工作台会话；从Set-Cookie取得Cookie，data.csrf_token取得CSRF
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/session
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{"stoken":"{{stoken}}","stuid":"{{stuid}}","mid":"{{mid}}"}

### 11 恢复工作台会话
GET {{base}}/api/workbench/session
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}

### 12 续期
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/session/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{}

### 13 退出
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/session/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{}

### 14 用服务端凭证重新查询绑定账号
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/game/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{}

### 15 实时总览并保存
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/overview
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"game_uid":"{{uid}}","game_biz":"hk4e_cn","region":"{{region}}"}

### 16 实时角色列表并保存
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/characters
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"game_uid":"{{uid}}","game_biz":"hk4e_cn","region":"{{region}}"}

### 17 实时装备并保存
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/characters/details
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"game_uid":"{{uid}}","game_biz":"hk4e_cn","region":"{{region}}","character_ids":["10000089"]}

### 18 只读已保存档案及最近10条查询记录，不请求米游社
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/saved
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"game_uid":"{{uid}}","game_biz":"hk4e_cn","region":"{{region}}"}

### 19 档案受阻后创建GT3任务
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/verification/start
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"game_uid":"{{uid}}","game_biz":"hk4e_cn","region":"{{region}}"}

### 20 提交本人完成的GT3验证；结果不可复用
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/verification/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"verification_id":"{{verification_id}}","geetest_challenge":"replace-with-manual-result","geetest_validate":"replace-with-manual-result","geetest_seccode":"replace-with-manual-result"}
